                    CUTTLEFISH PROJECT LICENSING

Cuttlefish contains hardware designs, firmware and software components
distributed under separate open-source licenses.

                              HARDWARE

All hardware design files located in the hardware/ directory, including
schematics, CAD models, and 3D-printable files, are licensed under the
CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).

The full license text is available in hardware/LICENSE.

                            MCU FIRMWARE

The microcontroller firmware located in the mcu-firmware/ directory
is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only).

The full license text is available in mcu-firmware/LICENSE.

                              SOFTWARE

Software components located in the software/ directory are licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0 only (GPL-3.0-only).

The full license text is available in software/LICENSE.

                       THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Third-party libraries, dependencies, and other externally developed
components remain under their respective licenses.
Please refer to their original license notices.
